  {
   "t": "h",
   "level": 1,
   "text": "Eyeglasses at Vue Eyecare",
   "html": "Eyeglasses at [[b]]Vue[[/b]] Eyecare"
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "Welcome to our Eyeglasses page, where clarity meets style in every pair. We understand that eyeglasses are more than just a vision correction tool; they are an expression of your personality and style. That's why we offer an extensive collection of eyewear to suit every taste, lifestyle, and vision need. From the latest trends to classic designs, our range ensures that you'll find the perfect frames to enhance your look and improve your vision."
  },
  {
   "t": "btn",
   "href": "https://p.adit.com/Rx8cZ",
   "text": "Schedule an Appointment"
  },
  {
   "t": "img",
   "src": "https://cdn.patientengage.cloud/sites/1ae885ad-ada7-41da-a3f2-c99458a5469b/live/media/019df9c3-60a5-7199-9576-249f89696aa1/shutterstock_2283445965.jpg@w_1600.webp",
   "alt": "A pair of black glasses with golden frames on a white surface",
   "w": 0,
   "h": 0,
   "shownW": 672
  },
  {
   "t": "img",
   "src": "https://cdn.patientengage.cloud/sites/1ae885ad-ada7-41da-a3f2-c99458a5469b/live/media/019dfefd-dd94-70a0-aa3a-8d91e392398e/shutterstock-334374272.jpg@w_1600.webp",
   "alt": "A smiling young man with glasses wearing a light blue button up shirt sits at a table.",
   "w": 0,
   "h": 0,
   "shownW": 568
  },
  {
   "t": "h",
   "level": 2,
   "text": "See Clearly With Our Prescription Eyeglasses",
   "html": "See Clearly With Our [[b]]Prescription Eyeglasses[[/b]]"
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "Our selection of prescription eyeglasses combines functionality with fashion. We believe that everyone deserves to enjoy clear vision without compromising on style. Our expert team is here to guide you through our diverse range of frame styles and lens options, ensuring your new glasses perfectly fit your vision requirements and aesthetic preferences."
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "Using advanced lens technology, we provide solutions for various vision corrections, including single vision, bifocals, and progressives, tailored to your individual needs."
  },
  {
   "t": "h",
   "level": 3,
   "text": "Prescription And Non-Prescription Sunglasses",
   "html": "Prescription And Non-Prescription [[b]]Sunglasses[[/b]]"
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "Protect your eyes in style with our collection of prescription and non-prescription sunglasses. Offering 100% UV protection, our sunglasses ensure your eyes are shielded from harmful rays while keeping you at the forefront of fashion."
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "Available in various shapes, colors, and styles, our sunglasses range caters to every preference, whether you're looking for the ultimate fashion accessory or functional sportswear. Let us help you find your next pair of sunglasses that combines the best of vision protection and style."
  },
