  {
   "t": "h",
   "level": 2,
   "text": "Glasses For Kids",
   "html": "Glasses For [[b]]Kids[[/b]]"
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "We haven't forgotten about our younger wearers. About 1 in 5 children needs prescription glasses to correct their vision. Our glasses for kids are designed with durability, comfort, and style in mind. Understanding the active lifestyle of children, we offer a wide selection of fun and sturdy frames that can keep up with their energy. From vibrant colors to frames featuring beloved characters, our kids' glasses are sure to delight and provide the vision support they need for their daily adventures."
  },
  {
   "t": "h",
   "level": 3,
   "text": "Special Eyewear For Specialty Needs",
   "html": "[[b]]Special Eyewear[[/b]] For Specialty Needs"
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "For those with specific vision needs, our specialty eyewear provides the perfect solution. Whether you require computer glasses to reduce digital eye strain, sports eyewear for superior performance and protection, or glasses designed for hobby-specific requirements, we have you covered."
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "Our specialty eyewear is designed to enhance your vision where you need it most, combining function with comfort and style."
  },
  {
   "t": "img",
   "src": "https://cdn.patientengage.cloud/sites/1ae885ad-ada7-41da-a3f2-c99458a5469b/live/media/019cc4e4-8120-7107-b2e5-959d1c26d579/AdobeStock_718280553.jpeg@w_1600.webp",
   "alt": "Woman with ski googles",
   "w": 0,
   "h": 0,
   "shownW": 568
  },
  {
   "t": "h",
   "level": 2,
   "text": "Transitions® Lenses",
   "html": "Transitions® Lenses"
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "Transitions® Lenses Optical, Inc. has developed the world's most advanced photochromic lens technology—the ability of a lens to darken in the presence of invisible UV light. Transitions® Lenses are the #1 brand of photochromic lenses recommended by eye care professionals worldwide."
  },
  {
   "t": "h",
   "level": 2,
   "text": "Lens Treatments",
   "html": "Lens Treatments"
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "Today’s eyeglass lens treatments make a real difference in what you see, and what you don’t see. Scratches, glare, ultraviolet rays—all are potential hazards to healthy sight that can be minimized or eliminated by a lens treatment."
  }
